Package: ASVD
Type: Package
Title: Algorithmic Selection and Variance Decomposition (ASVD)
Version: 1.5.0
Author: Anton Komissarenko, Vitaly Epishin
Maintainer: Anton Komissarenko <komissarenko_tosha@mail.ru>
Description: An analytical protocol for discovering emergent effects in complex systems. 
    ASVD utilizes Elastic Net regularization to identify high-order interactions 
    and non-linear patterns within large predictor sets. The protocol features 
    automated screening, robust re-estimation via bootstrap, and simple slopes 
    visualization to validate and interpret detected emergent phenomena.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
